      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَعَظَهُ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَعَظَ</span></b> , (K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَعْظٌ</span>, (TA,) <i>He
